  "description_short": "Community hub in Hartenbos offering coffee, groceries, and local conveniences near the beach.",
  "description_long": "Hartenbos Bayview Centre serves as a neighbourhood gathering spot where locals and holidaymakers pop in for essentials and a quick bite. The centre houses a coffee shop serving fresh brews and light meals, alongside a food store stocking everyday groceries and beach-day supplies. It's the kind of place where you grab your morning paper, pick up milk, and catch up with neighbours over a cappuccino.\n\nConveniently located in Bay View, the centre sits within easy reach of Hartenbos's popular beaches and holiday accommodation. The relaxed, practical atmosphere makes it a reliable stop whether you're self-catering in a nearby flat or just need provisions for a beach picnic. The coffee shop provides a welcome caffeine fix before hitting the sand, while the food store covers forgotten braai essentials and fresh basics. It's unpretentious local convenience done right, with friendly service that keeps regulars coming back throughout their Garden Route stay.",
